{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:418e7b3078742a07","name":"The Yuuzhan Vong Empire","source":{"id":"source:reference-418e7b3078742a07","title":"The Yuuzhan Vong Empire","revision":22151,"timestamp":"2024-08-31T12:42:44Z","sha256":"05eea53f148f7774757d105583784219a0cb3e2dbdf9109463d9cb820188aa89","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=22151","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=The%20Yuuzhan%20Vong%20Empire&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-418e7b3078742a07","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Core Rulebook"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Core_Rulebook"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["The ",{"tag":"a","children":["Yuuzhan Vong"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Yuuzhan_Vong","referenceId":"reference:93079e2f7d73d480"}," are humanoids that follow a religion of pain and nature. They hate machines of all kinds, using instead living technology that they have bioengineered to serve as ships, weapons, and tools. These fierce, holy warriors seek to conquer the galaxy and bring their faith to the infidels who regularly make use of unclean machines. Their invasion begins on far-flung worlds such as ",{"tag":"a","children":["Belkadan"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Belkadan?action=edit&redlink=1"}," and ",{"tag":"a","children":["Helska"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Helska?action=edit&redlink=1"},", but they quickly widen their hold on key sectors of ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Outer Rim"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Outer_Rim?action=edit&redlink=1"}," and ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Mid Rim"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Mid_Rim?action=edit&redlink=1"},", terraforming worlds to produce the yorik coral and other living materials that serve as their ships and weapons.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["The Jedi"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Jedi","referenceId":"reference:d320edb17de6c558"}," learn, to their horror, that this intractable new enemy cannot be sensed through ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Force","referenceId":"reference:67fe90e919b74d0f"},". ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Jedi"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Jedi","referenceId":"reference:d320edb17de6c558"},", former guardians of peace, become the hunted prey of the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Yuuzhan Vong"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Yuuzhan_Vong","referenceId":"reference:93079e2f7d73d480"},". Meanwhile, the extragalactic intruders continue their relentless advance toward ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Core"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Core?action=edit&redlink=1"},", crushing any force that dares stand in their way. A few worlds surrender without a fight, while those that resist are rendered uninhabitable. In time ",{"tag":"a","children":["Coruscant"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Coruscant","referenceId":"reference:2ee37a21e9e7a955"}," itself falls, signalling the death of ",{"tag":"a","children":["The New Republic"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_New_Republic","referenceId":"reference:e6046dbb57e5abb0"},".\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Eventually the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Yuuzhan Vong"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Yuuzhan_Vong","referenceId":"reference:93079e2f7d73d480"}," discover their history may not be as they thought, when the living planet ",{"tag":"a","children":["Zonama Sekot"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Zonama_Sekot","referenceId":"reference:60b35ed2dd2d676c"}," came to ",{"tag":"a","children":["Coruscant"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Coruscant","referenceId":"reference:2ee37a21e9e7a955"}," and fought defensively against the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Yuuzhan Vong"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Yuuzhan_Vong","referenceId":"reference:93079e2f7d73d480"},", \"welcoming home its true inhabitants.\" The new Galactic Federation of Free Alliances (",{"tag":"a","children":["The Galactic Alliance"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Galactic_Alliance","referenceId":"reference:bd53073ee6d4d9a0"},") allows the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Yuuzhan Vong"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Yuuzhan_Vong","referenceId":"reference:93079e2f7d73d480"}," to surrender and take ",{"tag":"a","children":["Zonama Sekot"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Zonama_Sekot","referenceId":"reference:60b35ed2dd2d676c"}," as their homeworld. While not all ",{"tag":"a","children":["Yuuzhan Vong"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Yuuzhan_Vong","referenceId":"reference:93079e2f7d73d480"}," accept this, the primary threat of the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Yuuzhan Vong"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Yuuzhan_Vong","referenceId":"reference:93079e2f7d73d480"}," ends as ",{"tag":"a","children":["Zonama Sekot"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Zonama_Sekot","referenceId":"reference:60b35ed2dd2d676c"}," flies into hyperspace to seek a new home for the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Yuuzhan Vong"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Yuuzhan_Vong","referenceId":"reference:93079e2f7d73d480"}," in ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Unknown Regions"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Unknown_Regions"},".\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Yuuzhan Vong Units"]},"\n",{"tag":"h4","children":["Nonheroic Units"]},"\n",{"tag":"table","children":["\n",{"tag":"tbody","children":[{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"th","children":["NAME\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["CHALLENGE LEVEL\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["SOURCE\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Yuuzhan Vong Advance Agent"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Yuuzhan_Vong_Advance_Agent","referenceId":"reference:54958b16ee4b0422"},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["CL 4\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"i","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Web E